{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/vd80wt","slideIndex":0,"text":"Hello, I’m Charith Kalhara, a Computer Science student at IIT Sri Lanka, affiliated with the University of Westminster. The professional identity I’m building sits at the intersection of software development and cloud operations. I enjoy taking a real process, turning it into a useful application, and then thinking through how to deploy and maintain it reliably. My short version is simple: I build practical software, then make it work reliably in the cloud. That combination is the thread connecting my projects and the direction I want to grow in.\n\nSource: https://lk.linkedin.com/in/charithkalhara"}
