{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/wln1ud","slideIndex":1,"text":"My technical strengths cover more than one layer of a product. I build web applications with PHP, Laravel and Filament, work with databases, and have also deployed Node.js workloads. I use Docker and GitHub Actions to package and automate releases, and I’ve worked with AWS and Oracle Cloud Infrastructure. In my cloud-native lab, I’ve been developing experience with Kubernetes, Terraform and Ansible, alongside Linux operations.\n\nThe strength I’m trying to make distinctive is the ability to connect these layers: understanding how a feature is built, how it reaches users, and what it needs to run securely and reliably. I’m still growing these skills through hands-on projects, and I want to keep deepening the engineering fundamentals behind them.\n\nSource: https://lk.linkedin.com/in/charithkalhara"}
