{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/6s2n1p","slideIndex":3,"text":"My next step is to grow toward cloud and DevOps engineering. I want to deepen my understanding of cloud-native architecture, infrastructure automation, deployment pipelines and service reliability, while continuing to build applications that address real operational needs.\n\nThe values I want people to associate with my work are responsibility, security and continuous learning. They show up in the way I think about protecting access, separating sensitive systems, and considering the people who depend on the software. I also co-authored a piece examining the ethical and governance questions around predictive AI in healthcare. That work reinforced for me that technical capability needs to be matched by careful judgment.\n\nMy professional brand is still developing, but the direction is clear: make technology useful, secure and dependable. Thank you.\n\nSource: https://lk.linkedin.com/in/charithkalhara"}